{
    "zh-CN": {
        "Vegeta": "Vegeta",
        "And so he left, desperate and stronger.": "于是他离开了，带着不甘与更强的力量。",
        "KINGMOD_VEGETA_SKIN_DEFAULT": "默认",
        "KINGMOD_VEGETA_SKIN_BADMAN": "Badman（便服）",
        "Saiyan Blood": "赛亚人血统",
        "Skills also require <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> to be used!\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Main Transformation</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (View Transformations Tab for more info).\n<color=#FF5400>Power down</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Fly</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>Jump</color>.": "使用技能还需要消耗<color=#03bcff>气</color>！\n轻按<color=#03f4fc>C</color>进行<color=#FF5400>主变身</color>（更多信息请查看“变身”标签页）。\n轻按<color=#03f4fc>X</color><color=#FF5400>解除变身</color>。\n按住<color=#03f4fc>跳跃</color>进行<color=#FF5400>飞行</color>。",
        "Melee Strike": "近战打击",
        "Deal <color=#E5C962>280% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auto-moves to targeted enemies.</color>": "每次攻击造成<color=#E5C962>280%伤害</color>！\n每次命中恢复<color=#03bcff>9%气</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>自动朝目标敌人移动。</color>",
        "Continuous Energy Blast": "连续能量弹",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>10 Ki</color>\nConcentrate and rapidly fire Ki Blasts, Dealing <color=#E5C962>120% Damage</color> with each one!\n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill drains </color><color=#03bcff>18 Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>per second.</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>10气</color>\n凝聚并快速发射气弹，每发造成<color=#E5C962>120%伤害</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>按住此技能每秒消耗</color><color=#03bcff>18气</color><color=#03f4fc>。</color>",
        "Rising Sledgehammer": "升龙重锤",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nStrike and launch enemies upwards, dealing <color=#E5C962>400% Damage</color>!\nHolding the button follows-up with an additional downward strike, knocking-down enemies and dealing <color=#E5C962>1100% Damage</color>!\n": "消耗<color=#03bcff>30气</color>\n上挑并击飞敌人，造成<color=#E5C962>400%伤害</color>！\n按住按钮会追加一次下砸重击，击倒敌人并造成<color=#E5C962>1100%伤害</color>！\n",
        "Empowered Ki Charge": "强化气力充能",
        "Hold and Regenerate <color=#03bcff>30% Ki</color> Per Second!": "按住以每秒恢复<color=#03bcff>30%气</color>！",
        "Flip": "空翻",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nPerform a quick flip in a direction.\n<color=#03f4fc>Gain Invulnerability whilst skill is active</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>20气</color>\n向指定方向快速空翻。\n<color=#03f4fc>技能持续期间获得无敌状态</color>",
        "Galick Gun": "伽力克炮",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>40 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Galick Gun, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1500% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>800% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>40气</color>\n蓄力并释放伽力克炮，光束持续期间每秒造成<color=#E5C962>1500%伤害</color>！\n消耗额外气，每蓄力一秒使伤害提高<color=#E5C962>800%伤害</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>蓄力越久，气的消耗逐渐增加！</color>",
        "Galaxy Breaker": "银河破坏者",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nGenerate immense power to fire an energy wave upwards, dealing <color=#E5C962>3600% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!\nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1600% Damage</color> and size per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>100气</color>\n积蓄庞大能量并向上发射能量波，光束持续期间每秒造成<color=#E5C962>3600%伤害</color>！\n消耗额外气，每蓄力一秒使伤害提高<color=#E5C962>1600%伤害</color>并扩大范围！\n<color=#03f4fc>蓄力越久，气的消耗逐渐增加！</color>",
        "Big Bang Attack": "大爆炸攻击",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nUnleash an explosive ball of energy! \nExplodes on hit, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1600% Damage</color>!\n": "消耗<color=#03bcff>60气</color>\n释放一颗爆炸性能量球！\n命中时爆炸，造成<color=#E5C962>1600%伤害</color>！\n",
        "Final Flash": "终极闪光",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>120 Ki</color>\nCharge up and unleash a devastating Final Flash, Dealing <color=#E5C962>3000% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "消耗<color=#03bcff>120气</color>\n蓄力并释放毁灭性的终极闪光，光束持续期间每秒造成<color=#E5C962>3000%伤害</color>！",
        "Final Explosion": "终极爆炸",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nRelease a massively expanding explosion, Dealing <color=#E5C962>2500% Damage</color> and\ndraining <color=#03bcff>40% of Max Ki</color> per second!\n<color=#FF0000>Once Ki reaches 0, Health is drained instead, Can be fatal...</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>200气</color>\n释放急速扩张的大爆炸，造成<color=#E5C962>2500%伤害</color>并\n每秒消耗<color=#03bcff>40%最大气</color>！\n<color=#FF0000>气耗尽后将改为消耗生命值，可能致命……</color>",
        "Prominence Flash": "闪耀冲击",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nCharge up and unleash a devastating God-level Prominence Flash, Dealing <color=#E5C962>4000% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "消耗<color=#03bcff>200气</color>\n蓄力并释放毁灭性的神级闪耀冲击，光束持续期间每秒造成<color=#E5C962>4000%伤害</color>！",
        "Niagra Pummel": "尼亚加拉连打",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nPower up and unleash a insanely fast barrage of strikes! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>222% Damage</color> for each one!\nFinishing it off with a powerful blow, Dealing <color=#E5C962>666% Damage</color>!": "消耗<color=#03bcff>300气</color>\n爆气强化并施展极速连击！\n每一击造成<color=#E5C962>222%伤害</color>！\n最后以强力一击收尾，造成<color=#E5C962>666%伤害</color>！",
        "Full Power Final Explosion": "全力终极爆炸",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>400 Ki</color>\nRelease a massively expanding explosion,  Dealing <color=#E5C962>2700% Damage</color> and\ndraining <color=#03bcff>20% of Max Ki</color> per second!\n<color=#FF0000>Once Ki reaches 0, Health is drained instead, this version won't kill you...</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>400气</color>\n释放急速扩张的大爆炸，造成<color=#E5C962>2700%伤害</color>并\n每秒消耗<color=#03bcff>20%最大气</color>！\n<color=#FF0000>气耗尽后将改为消耗生命值，但此版本不会致死……</color>",
        "Final Shine Attack": "终极闪光炮",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color>\nUnleash a powerful Final Shine Attack, Dealing <color=#E5C962>3600% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "消耗<color=#03bcff>80气</color>\n释放强力的终极闪光炮，光束持续期间每秒造成<color=#E5C962>3600%伤害</color>！",
        "Super Galick Gun": "超级伽力克炮",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Super Galick Gun, Dealing <color=#E5C962>8000% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "消耗<color=#03bcff>300气</color>\n蓄力并释放超级伽力克炮，光束持续期间每秒造成<color=#E5C962>8000%伤害</color>！",
